//! check: run(exit=0, stdout="7 9\n")
//! phase: run
//! conforms: mem.model.place.elem, mem.tier0.borrow, mem.dyn.unsize
//!
//! eg02 (EGC's EG2) — `[mem.tier0.borrow]` per element: `let o = xs[0] as
//! dyn Draw` is a shared loan of `xs[0]` (D47), live until `o.draw()`; the
//! store `xs[1] = Dot { x: 9 }` lands inside it at a distinct literal, and
//! a list store never moves the buffer. `7 9` on checked, native, release
//! and lupin 0.1.41; E1002 on every wolfgang lane through 0.2.18. Its
//! one-place twin is `elem_dyn_dyn_loan.lu`.
